		{"id":"d14809f05ad6075c","type":"text","text":"## DECIDE (LLMs, read-only)\nLangGraph: ingest → forensics → match → score_risk → investigate? → short_pay_decide → policy_gate → human_review (interrupt) → approve_for_payment\n\nA1–A7 · zero write tools (R2, R14)","x":-1460,"y":-500,"width":500,"height":300,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"39ae89e0a135945a","type":"text","text":"## EXECUTE (no LLM)\nSettlementService.execute(execution_id)\nreserve spend (R8) → POST payout (PENDING) → webhook/poll SUCCESS → VendorGateway record payment → SETTLED","x":-900,"y":-500,"width":460,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"0b4e4886eb000e60","type":"text","text":"## PayPal sandbox\n**Treasury app** — Payouts, payout webhooks, list_transactions\n**Vendor app** — Invoicing, invoicing webhooks\nTwo distinct accounts (R12)","x":-1460,"y":-150,"width":500,"height":240},
		{"id":"caa155adf81fddd2","type":"text","text":"## Non-negotiables (§4)\nR1 payee lock · R3 amount derivation · R4 integer cents · R5 idempotency · R6 async payouts · R8 atomic cap · R9 duplicates · R10 webhook verify · R11 HITL integrity","x":-900,"y":-150,"width":460,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"03fb72467c33c5c7","type":"text","text":"## Scenarios (§15)\n**S1** happy path → AUTO_SETTLE $480\n**S2** damaged → SHORT_PAY $425 (+ notice $75)\n**S3** BEC + injection → FREEZE, dual approval, reject; kill-switch proof\n**S4** duplicate → blocked < 1 s\n**S5** (P2) stale payee → UNCLAIMED","x":-1460,"y":140,"width":500,"height":440},
		{"id":"1392751eb4834f15","type":"file","file":"PRD_SRS.md","x":-900,"y":200,"width":460,"height":380},
		{"id":"fc166eb81361ff31","type":"text","text":"## Routing (deterministic)\n.claude/routing.json → UserPromptSubmit hook prints `route → agent / review / skills / rules`\nPath rules auto-load: money-safety · backend · frontend · ai-agents","x":-660,"y":-1250,"width":440,"height":240},
		{"id":"7e6ba5052e452888","type":"text","text":"## Hooks\nSessionStart: pull + brief\nUserPromptSubmit: route\nPost-test: pull --rebase, push, commit nudge\nFailed test: never push","x":-180,"y":-1250,"width":440,"height":240},
