		{"id":"2629fb6d2384da89","type":"text","text":"## Ponytail personas\n**Ledger** — ponytail-backend\n**Pixel** — ponytail-frontend\n**Sentinel** — ponytail-ai\n+ caveman (terse chat) · ECC reviewers","x":300,"y":-1250,"width":460,"height":240},
		{"id":"eccc4fdd5c655985","type":"text","text":"## Memory\nECC team vault `.ecc/memory/team/`\nmemory-keeper: /standup · /handoff · spawns skills\nstate = CHECKLIST, log = SESSION_LOG","x":-660,"y":-980,"width":440,"height":230},
