		{"id":"dc76e9f0c0006e8f","type":"text","text":"# AegisPay\nZero-trust agentic payables on PayPal.\nPay only **verified vendors**, only for **goods received**, only within a **signed mandate**.\n\nSubmit **2026-11-11** · judging Dec 1–15","x":-300,"y":-120,"width":600,"height":240,"color":"1"},
