		{"id":"c7e5ce427f47992a","type":"text","text":"## Dev A — PayPal, settlement, agents\n`claude --agent ponytail-backend` / `ponytail-ai`\nOwns backend paypal/settlement/decision/forensics/agents/routers, adr/, EVAL, TOOLS, SANDBOX_SETUP\nNext: P1-03+ PayPal clients, settlement","x":-660,"y":820,"width":700,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"59a5bff631b04b73","type":"text","text":"## Dev B — full stack + data, AG Studio, video\n`claude --agent ponytail-frontend` / `ponytail-backend` (data)\nOwns frontend/, backend models/db/config/audit/demo, migrations, docker-compose, CI, render.yaml, USER_RESEARCH\nNext: P1-01 skeleton → P1-02 ORM, P0-13 SPIKE-7","x":80,"y":820,"width":680,"height":320,"color":"3"}
